0 minutes dans une cabane d'hiver chaleureuse et confortable avec notre doux guide de m\u00e9ditation. Dans cette m\u00e9ditation guid\u00e9e pour s'endormir, nous vous guiderons \u00e0 travers la neige jusqu'\u00e0 votre propre cabane en rondins confortable. Vous pourrez vous asseoir devant le feu et regarder la soir\u00e9e se transformer en nuit, sachant que vous \u00eates au chaud et en s\u00e9curit\u00e9 dans ce sanctuaire \u00e0 l'abri de la temp\u00eate. D\u00e9velopp\u00e9 par Bournemouth University en collaboration avec le projet ASPIRE.", "short_description": "Une application de m\u00e9ditation guid\u00e9e, d\u00e9velopp\u00e9e pour le projet ASPIRE par Bournemouth University."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.bournemouth.ac.uk/research/projects/aspire/privacy-policy-aspire-vr-cabin-relaxation", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Bournemouth University", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.bournemouth.ac.uk/research/projects/aspire", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "213841827936442"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031615_234657172372274_7565424000324937758_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KX4DC-zb8lUQ7kNvwFcHHFu&_nc_oc=Admcn1z3hMdM45